              "summary": "A User class inherits from BaseModel and declares username and email as string fields. Neither field has a default, so constructing User without arguments produces validation errors identifying both missing fields. Supplying strings for both fields succeeds. Adding bio with an empty-string default and is_active with a True default allows those fields to be omitted during construction; the resulting instance receives their declared defaults. Here, “optional fields” means fields that may be omitted because they have defaults.",
